<BaseLayout title="Terms of Use | China Attractions in Beijing" description="Terms of use for China Attractions in Beijing: informational content disclaimer, price accuracy notice, copyright, and external links policy.">
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 pt-12 pb-16">
    <h1 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold tracking-tight text-base-900 mb-6">Terms of Use</h1>
    <p class="text-sm text-base-500 mb-8">Last updated: September 4, 2026</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-base-900 mb-3">Acceptance</h2>
    <p class="text-base text-base-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">By using china-attractions-in-beijing.com you agree to these terms. If you do not agree, please do not use the site.</p>

    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-base-900 mb-3">Informational content &mdash; not a travel agency</h2>
    <p class="text-base text-base-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">This site is an independent editorial guide. We are not a tour operator, ticket reseller, or travel agency, and we are not affiliated with any attraction, hotel, or government body. Content is provided for general information &ldquo;as is&rdquo; without warranties of any kind.</p>
