    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-base-900 mb-3">External links</h2>
    <p class="text-base text-base-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">We link to official ticketing sites, transit information, and other resources we consider useful. We do not control those sites and are not responsible for their content, availability, or practices. Links are editorial recommendations, not paid placements.</p>

