    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-base-900 mb-3">Contact</h2>
    <p class="text-base text-base-600 leading-relaxed mb-6">Questions about these terms: <a href="mailto:hello@china-attractions-in-beijing.com" class="text-accent hover:underline">hello@china-attractions-in-beijing.com</a></p>

    <p class="text-sm text-base-500 mt-8 pt-8 border-t border-base-200">See also our <a href="/privacy-policy/" class="text-accent hover:underline">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="/about/" class="text-accent hover:underline">About page</a>.</p>
